ui.changelog:title=%s Changelog
ui.changelog.label:1=§9Welcome to v1.0.4! This update brings even more stability improvements and adds a few new features that you all asked for in the discord!
ui.changelog.header:changes=§eFeatures/Changes§r
ui.changelog.label:2=- Gamerule changes are now optional; a setup ui will ask.
ui.changelog.label:3=- The "shovel.op" tag is no longer needed, all world operators have access to the op panel now.
ui.changelog.label:4=- Added first point selection particles.
ui.changelog.label:5=- Claims you can't enter will now render with §cred particles§r.
ui.changelog.label:6=- Improved mobile controls.
ui.changelog.label:7=- Split "Hurt Entities" permision into "Hurt Mobs", "Hurt Monsters", and "Hurt Players"
ui.changelog.header:bug_fixes=§bBug Fixes§r
ui.changelog.label:8=- Crouching while not holding an item no longer bypasses claim permissions.
ui.changelog.label:9=- Lava chicken farms no longer cause the server to hang. :)
ui.changelog.label:10=- Improved form error message handling.
ui.changelog.label:11=- Fixed UI navigation handling.
ui.changelog.label:12=- Ridden entity is no longer dismounted when entering a disallowed claim.
ui.changelog.label:13=- Resolved several console errors.
ui.changelog.label:14=- Entity health is no longer reset when taking disallowed damage.
ui.changelog.label:15=- Fixed monsters not burning in sunlight within claims.
ui.changelog.label:16=- Fixed menu not re-appearing after viewing a claim.
ui.changelog.label:17=- Fixed various other issues with entity protection.
ui.changelog.button:back=<< Main Menu

